# {project_title} — Conventions

This repository was onboarded onto alan with the **python** stack preset. It is
managed with [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/); `uv sync` installs dependencies and
`uv run <tool>` runs project tooling.

## Commands

```bash
uv sync
uv run pytest
uv run ruff check .
```

## Gates (CI, `.github/workflows/ci.yml`)

The `python-ci` check runs on every pull request and must pass before merge:

- `uv run pytest`
- `uv run ruff check .`

## Dependencies

Dependabot (`.github/dependabot.yml`) opens weekly update pull requests for both
project dependencies and GitHub Actions.
